# CODEOWNERS for sc-kpi-api
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Teams hierarchy (sc-kpi/digital-transformation):
#   leadership / management, tech-leads
#   engineering / frontend, backend, devops
#   design
#   qa / qa-manual, qa-automation

# Default owners — Tech Leads have oversight of all code
*                                       @sc-kpi/tech-leads

# Application modules
/modules/                               @sc-kpi/backend @sc-kpi/tech-leads
/common/                                @sc-kpi/backend @sc-kpi/tech-leads
/app/                                   @sc-kpi/backend @sc-kpi/tech-leads

# Security-sensitive code (requires tech lead approval)
**/security/                            @sc-kpi/tech-leads @sc-kpi/backend
**/auth/                                @sc-kpi/tech-leads @sc-kpi/backend
**/filter/                              @sc-kpi/tech-leads @sc-kpi/backend
/modules/module-auth/                   @sc-kpi/tech-leads @sc-kpi/backend

# Database migrations (requires tech lead approval)
**/db/migration/                        @sc-kpi/tech-leads @sc-kpi/backend

# Tests
**/test/                                @sc-kpi/backend @sc-kpi/qa-automation

# Configuration and infrastructure
/.github/                               @sc-kpi/devops @sc-kpi/tech-leads
Dockerfile                              @sc-kpi/devops
docker-compose*.yml                     @sc-kpi/devops
build.gradle                            @sc-kpi/backend @sc-kpi/devops
settings.gradle                         @sc-kpi/backend @sc-kpi/devops
gradle.properties                       @sc-kpi/backend @sc-kpi/devops

# Application configuration
**/application*.yml                     @sc-kpi/backend @sc-kpi/devops
**/application*.yaml                    @sc-kpi/backend @sc-kpi/devops
**/application*.properties              @sc-kpi/backend @sc-kpi/devops

# Documentation
*.md                                    @sc-kpi/management
/docs/                                  @sc-kpi/management @sc-kpi/tech-leads
CHANGELOG.md                            @sc-kpi/management @sc-kpi/devops
